cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Signal Viewer in work you publish, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Signal Viewer"
abstract: >-
  An offline desktop workbench to analyse and validate time-series and measurement data - test runs,
  simulation output (MATLAB / Simulink), CSV, Parquet, HDF5, CAN, ROS 2 and flight logs, and parameter
  sweeps - with pass / fail checks for continuous integration and a numerical validation of its computations.
